WEBVTT

25:30.812 --> 25:34.064
-I'm gonna teach that boy a lesson.
-Yeah, sure. You go ahead.

25:34.149 --> 25:36.525
Melt him with your scary laser.

25:36.610 --> 25:39.570
Be careful with that!
It's extremely dangerous.

25:39.654 --> 25:42.406
He's lighting it!
He's lighting it! Hit the dirt!

25:43.241 --> 25:45.284
Look out!

25:49.498 --> 25:52.082
Yes! He's gone! He's history!

25:53.668 --> 25:55.252
I could've stopped him.

25:55.337 --> 25:58.506
Buzz, I would love
to see you try.

25:58.924 --> 26:01.050
Of course, I'd love
to see you as a crater.
